{"parts":[{"function_response":{"id":"nlm7pbHs","name":"list_skills","response":{"result":"<available_skills>\n<skill>\n<name>\nproduct-search\n</name>\n<description>\nSearches the skincare product database to find products matching user skin concerns, skin type, ingredients, or general text queries. Returns product details with clickable links. Use when a user asks about skincare products, wants recommendations based on their skin condition, or needs to find specific products.\n</description>\n</skill>\n<skill>\n<name>\nskin-analysis\n</name>\n<description>\nAnalyzes a face photo to identify skin conditions (acne, blackheads, wrinkles, redness, dark spots, oiliness, dryness, etc.) and provides personalized skincare recommendations. Activates when the user uploads a face photo and asks about their skin, or asks whether a specific product suits them.\n</description>\n</skill>\n</available_skills>"}}}],"role":"user"}
{"parts":[{"text":"**Greeting the User**\n\nI'm ready to warmly greet the user! As a skincare consultant, I can explain how I can help them. I'll focus on providing assistance based on their needs.\n\n\n","thought":true},{"text":"Hello! I'm your virtual skincare consultant. \n\nHow can I help you today? You can:\n- **Upload a clear face photo** for a first-pass skin assessment (we can look at things like texture, breakouts, redness, fine lines, or oiliness).\n- **Tell me about your skin type or concerns** (e.g., acne, dark spots, dryness), and I can recommend tailored products from our database.\n- **Share your current routine or specific products**, and we can evaluate whether they are a good match for your skin goals.\n\nFeel free to upload a picture or let me know what you'd like to focus on!"},{"text":"","thought_signature":"Ep0HCpoHARFNMg_D1efcwNz_L5G_x6gEiTk6mXEqc3Wx3GPhwxcShu8CvH7vjcqwdoE8a4a-BZ3JjcIUx6I-wvaWnmjJ1lzlva_FG1SAl9mW7vbY3QIkjbvLqflTQc8Ab_0IiG2UYO7lc08g_SxFJP-pDd0i_AkqV2hHN26W3qXdQjzpHDEMDV2z2xp86Qf-OYn2pqDpeEZNUG1FzPdsF4mjcx7yJDvMKkhHOjFJSBTSfTKt1VoVLDQO9PFJSnAl3XwkMxdj7SkB6OpVciR9yOFTJNGSM8SmgWHCFDUCoIllxIHnW_R20FEwYDGBH7ImpDJDVE4FkYCzbZigY4Xd6GdG-Gu6frgQXnLDsWe-5oDUu_-iGRR-EFaTI09RZCgxvkWJGHIM9lSPkajRnU1Y0WlVy1pQCaLQWzqjppphwpFuUhekW_f16mksc32QF80-fNAJM-9BWgUfcEKfYN-aYQ7OZsXDd_gwApfN1WLyQSEASDlIhZsslGrfh3CrD9FDceg23Gw_7OqASSu5MjqDLslgsVmlrFi12-rDshDH8NBoyMHWwAO_Y-ipIBoLsRFhYkAEz95snYGcXFpUCa8hLMjUtknvbywsphXXQPu3T054nFezMT4iTJEkYHmw3uvnFSJ4ZmPdilN8gjm1XH-XzH4w0WZ9QrjEbNtMgmB6lxowadxmQ654b5bSD9Ei4siz1i4-GOK4Bt-qvUIiH6fBRGp7R2SOSWHruTjsNrdIm9nZYwp-_wQTCxKNYwwTlpvXnW7U9A7mlelZcFmIy2X1Pc6psGz-wunnlXbWjxX0bcQtfAZpIWAh4QpMXtsoUY6Dfk5_fS4A9OURtrh6K125MvXZvqJM8CZkjss_0ZF-esjbYSejsNnux3Tq0wVYtg0BriWsxhIiED-GnI5inRcdzGOoGlDzaWOkOxLkn-689kO4m05DL637ZP51QevX9lpqCYyImG-o-U_M1HAv1zQP9K0f6K73-H-Fd0k8goctFmSi3Li02FuKhNhImTVohjbiiCG21se_0t86DXvvZQmHnNKe4Z2QR1nBAl72UW7TEulEf2GoQ2GGJmTTJVEfUjkrwTirsExnZMzWQWWxfAI03Mdgjng5fxcTZkHiaT0HbK6Q7lzRLLByBvllpHLjEJpy5z1R6wb