{"parts":[{"text":"**Analyzing Facial Features**\n\nOkay, I've started meticulously examining the uploaded image. My focus is now on the facial features, primarily the cheek and jawline. I've noted active breakouts and inflamed papules, especially near the upper cheek area.\n\n\n**Detailing Skin Condition**\n\nI'm now zeroing in on the specific skin condition. Observations point to active acne papules across the cheek area, alongside post-inflammatory hyperpigmentation, scattered dark spots, and enlarged pores, particularly near the nose. The overall skin texture is uneven, a result of both active bumps and residual marks, suggesting an oily to combination skin type.\n\n\n**Formulating Recommendations**\n\nI'm now formulating concrete recommendations based on my observations. I'm suggesting salicylic acid, niacinamide, and azelaic acid to address active breakouts and clogged pores, and a different set to tackle the post-inflammatory hyperpigmentation. A gentle, non-comedogenic moisturizer and broad-spectrum sunscreen are crucial. I'm estimating a 4-8 week timeline for improvement, and I need to check for current products.\n\n\n","thought":true},{"function_call":{"id":"y22LmUtf","args":{"skin_concerns":"acne, dark spots, blackheads"},"name":"search_products"},"thought_signature":"EpMeCpAeARFNMg8DBf2qfqneXC3zJ6NB_9Nbw_-3KFYxdLrHm4_RiJWRK7zjjvDDPYLGRgVbraLZe6iajJc4tqweEV-ZLxT8grpG8tDY3S7-xXVyvEfziALwu8aM5aAGbngjhk5F7qgQ0_QciCQFv7Stqw-cWyuHB3tPr9ep6brDEmxFcMha5Z9IPTXMvGMRC5o5t8N1SRJGv3350pt4D5HaFSxa5GQauA-Ue848FAfKnpk8i2asBmUsgJZNUZjRmIyrRg1_RHsA-yXFuyWLc02AWUCxzIkOsnUnKSj5dFK86iLGWbnclCDZZnlXXOkM3FUDaxeYB18JCiHXk7o7QznObLWiduu31oDPNUZ4dwiiZu3Ha3PpeFR5cipwICbauPZEIBLsH9Qt8Hf2lb7aV0pTl1XL1DRk7PEHlGYa14R1VR0B647Tp3r7s1Z30elJY-vLdtRiP9Fyb5vuSE5gxgkVAcuyYNxS7JZOApH-Pl54wHsu1U45qjRAT0_nAhHleYcXZ6ays30-46JcoR6XuahxUsmp0kXibQKNI3a5lRbUoBhL66zxTZrvCN8_3iZUP-eC9jdtj-AcCHKtMuWve3qKZBG1pg2LEBNTRhvi1A53gOkbluogHVZeEHPs9aQlubBZD656qnhNqlNXAnzvR_oAXXIKZVnasNAvh3RyQwy32eTuDh50NWE-xW03