{"parts":[{"text":"**Acknowledging the Request**\n\nOkay, I've received the image and request for product recommendations. I'm moving forward with the plan. I'm leveraging the `load_skill` tool to obtain specific instructions from the \"skin-analysis\" skill, which should guide me in this process. I'm ready to proceed, getting this skill information loaded should be very informative.\n\n\n","thought":true},{"function_call":{"id":"jC2qdU02","args":{"skill_name":"skin-analysis"},"name":"load_skill"},"thought_signature":"ErILCq8LARFNMg8e_GoKx4QD7bM6Gj0kF1KdWi9MC9VoG3hK1RZ5ZHzyDszZmf6r_IUM8gH08oeXn6rOY7N1XqM7xbP_ocGt1AY1KYQkqrnByZci2iMfRz8SoQu7zZA4UDaGpQqbpxMmrWqCmmHUDbaytyjuoScgTVz6QUOKiTjIdP-gEkZwbQu4tZ7pQiUJnevnjp9lzCi-r9Gln8cX0HLKBIA3ro9iuzZaKf62grkfcA_Onm4nvH0mSMsW_TPgVddktrr6XWkZVv8I4-gprx3lsgpUWYJn9uoi01Eil3dZPKCRe91Axrsii23GKbuwkmp3cmt8lgpYwUa_tclNkcWcERsxWI6wmWcwDrERht9Oxv2Lx85THUL9NtYXWe_gwXLSxFP7tUZSc8qdmy1U1E3hc-J0X2eP9qWidTZv5m0t8ORzRcM4vmP02K7_4CUtmmRko_CUTOPHG2kYI_o65Zx-PxTy0RB6b5Vnv3Q30XQ9gQoddGsPm4fJFn6xS1oocPJGPzalk0IQ-cqv9una4W2dV760dU2cfpm29SAJtMSB4QuH5cisfh2XplgolnteIgbP4HPM1tZTgnbFo_AwqKhIrpfg0UulnAU_Y9mTrepa7-hqRzneL6Dug5CJGqdvNt6Ig6c5nMm_qwoqjTJdlVAhkV5WUz4cL1JvmCU2MIFej0cG80xLzoy3DDPKxUcpojmxDFiiGnu2yoW6Ak-HgBopoArLjQpM-HAMNYD0297nhV3dKa3kzzHr_khAcZ6jPxf7mug9o8vh83tQy_xVndduuVUYlBrA871PyeMtM8ZTL8i5IX4McnBhDZl8TogwqMj8HOfgLZyPseZVP7M1lOyzQBdhQAtSwCRfGZR3nMJBsXCPZ2AhRlk-M_qXLZCvj2ZAyGGSn5KtjnwqN16qIuYSF8X28Bz6Z6cZtTHeQAYy0yj20RfkgMKU6G0lyIKP2wl1epbpkwOYjHRVPdO1pn_vFp8mHSt6zgMzmar6WOcDt-VRP3C8bUiqlh-JEG0ha7IrCLVIH04ZZTke2qmgiAnhKZvwjqawnZEzg6h-O3NEo8dvswhLXgi9jzxVsa5jF0OuNMeSFNuFXTHe5yH109s2iNb8Cxp1jUFZgBWM2FCqo4rWWNP2SgSdfUGMew5WAX1XKos_t5-hoa2Xt3YCuIuJ78J4AEpGj5_yi8gCiBWo25sBp4GfexPnZykuQfsOyP0yus-m1r5WvJ2PUXPIJek5gAex-2azYttScGDnxYqXItN1EM9U9nmFBS_Eflw_c59sIkRCcATs9mq7q9RY3C_qG6Cy0bpNEN5d63M6PoxCdvVfjP1goj0ULZl8AEJR67oiGrETVpl9nIO_vFdWdC2YEl13s8bPVs5G0NMUuZQKhrbeRF8wBhofRf86PvB3UQQcktb86SZmnEERFVeKeRnFcivIbYhjqbJVbk-M_BXMGxkSO-7rczJVZVqRmJjLcbDj